      '[LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED: statutory withdrawal / cooling-off wording for the applicable jurisdiction, including whether a right of withdrawal applies to this service, its length, and the effect of the customer asking us to begin work during that period]': '[LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED: statutory withdrawal / cooling-off wording for the applicable jurisdiction, including whether a right of withdrawal applies to this service, its length, and the effect of the customer asking us to begin work during that period]',
