      'Frequently asked questions': 'Veelgestelde vragen', 'From': 'Van', 'From the': 'Van de',
      'Full Website': 'Volledige website', 'Full Website (': 'Volledige Website (',
      'Full Website builds all thirty-four with no cap, and does the setup work every site needs anyway — search indexing, analytics, the cookie banner and legal pages, spam protection. The': 'Met Volledige Website bouwen wij alle vierendertig zonder cap, en doen wij het instelwerk dat elke site toch nodig heeft — zoekindexering, analytics, de cookiebanner en juridische pagina\'s, spambescherming. De',
      'Full delivery terms are in clause 05 of the': 'De volledige leveringsvoorwaarden staan in clausule 05 van de',
